        {
          "text": "Mutalyi cinkwa cili abumena antoomwe ancico; mazuba aali musanu aabili muleelede kulya zinkwa zitakwe bumena, zinkwa zyamapenzi, (nkaambo mwakazwa mucisi ca-Egepita kamugubide), kuti mutalubi buzuba bwanu bwakuzwa munyika ya-Egepita mazuba oonse aabuumi bwanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
