        {
          "text": "Mazuba aali musanu abumwi zilaligwa zinkwa zitakwe bumena; lino mubuzuba bwamusanu aabili kulaba imbungano iisalalisya ya-Jehova Leza wanu; mubuzuba obo mutaciti mulimo nuba umwi.",
